# slug: ch74-acquire
# source: chapters/ch74.tex:129
# label: alg:ch74-acquire
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch74.tex:132
# caption: Acquire and publish an owned result with complete failure cleanup.

REQUIRE ordered acquisitions with matching nonthrowing releases
ENSURE published owner or no outstanding acquired resources
initialize cleanup list to empty
FORALL required resources DO
  attempt acquisition
  IF acquisition fails THEN
    release recorded resources in reverse order; propagate failure
  END IF
  record its release action
END FOR
publish owner; transfer its resources out of the cleanup list
release remaining temporary resources

